MODIFICATIONS IN THIS FORK
================================================================================

This fork includes the following significant modifications:

Security Enhancements:
- Removal of external API integrations and third-party dependencies
- Comprehensive CSRF protection with nonce verification
- User capability checks on all data modification operations
- Secure CSV file upload with size limits and random filenames
- SQL injection prevention using parameterized queries
- XSS prevention with proper output escaping
- Enhanced input validation and sanitization

Performance Improvements:
- Database indexes on stock_log table
- Automatic stock log cleanup mechanism
- Query caching with WordPress transients

Code Quality:
- Error logging utility (WSM_Logger)
- Input validation helper (WSM_Validator)
- Improved error handling for file and database operations
- Enhanced internationalization

Documentation:
- Comprehensive security audit documentation (claude.md)
- Updated README with fork information
- This NOTICE file

For a complete list of changes, see the git commit history.


